# The golden corpus. Its files are deliberately broken skills - secrets that are not
# secrets, commands nobody should run, an unclosed fence - so scanning them as part of
# THIS skill would report every one of them as a defect of the suite itself.
#
# What is listed here is not read at all: nothing about it is checked and nothing about
# it is claimed. That is the difference between this file and `sqs-allow`, which says
# "found it, and it is meant to be there".
